"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**If you don't use this template, your issue will be closed. Delete this text once completed.**\r\n\r\n**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nI'd like to use Licensee (https://github.com/cashapp/licensee) but version 3.7.0 of Lottie does not publish it's license information in the POM. \r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nPlease include the Apache 2.0 license in the POM file. \r\nhttps://github.com/airbnb/lottie-android/blob/master/LICENSE\r\n\r\nThis could be as simple as including the following in gradle.properties\r\n\r\n```\r\nPOM_LICENSE_NAME=The Apache Software License, Version 2.0\r\nPOM_LICENSE_URL=https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt\r\nPOM_LICENSE_DIST=repo\r\n```\r\n\r\n(more info: https://github.com/vanniktech/gradle-maven-publish-plugin/#setting-properties)\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nThe workaround is currently having Licensee ignore Lottie, which is not ideal. \r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nHappy to answer any questions, but should be a very simple fix. \r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airbnb/lottie-android/issues/1960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airbnb/lottie-android/issues/1960/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6168259340,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBC8mW85E8XG4zwAAAAFvqCsM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airbnb/lottie-android/issues/events/6168259340","actor":{"login":"PaulWoitaschek","id":743462,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MzQ2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/743462?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulWoitaschek","html_url":"https://github.com/PaulWoitaschek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulWoitaschek/followers","following_